WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.850
<b>Coffee Shop</b>

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:04.400
Ta-da!

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:08.860
The script for the Hitotose Troupe's 
first performance is complete!

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:12.400
Here you go.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.910
Thanks.

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:15.050
Here, Hina-chan.

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:17.280
And Mayu-chan.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:18.370
Thanks.

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:25.880
Yeah. I like it.

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:27.660
All right!

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:31.200
The ending might change, depending 
on how the production works out,

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.690
but that's the general idea 
that I want to go with.

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:35.510
It's amazing!

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:42.130
For this part...

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:44.020
Let's see...

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:46.650
You look really happy, Mayu-chan.

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:50.520
Well, now that the story's 
come together, that means...

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:53.480
...we can start trying on costumes, right?

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:32.000
<b>Pa-Pa-Parade</b>

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.750
<b>Used Bookstore Hitotose</b>

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:38.010
I went out and got the perfect 
costumes for each of you.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:40.740
I'd love to see you try them on right away!

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:43.570
You're in quite the rush, aren't you?

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:46.050
When do most troupes do this?

00:02:46.050 --> 00:02:48.280
Right before the show, I think.

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:50.420
They call it the "parade."

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:51.650
Parade?

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:57.400
Not that kind of parade!

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:59.030
Huh? It's not?

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:02.130
The "dress parade" is when

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:03.970
the actors line up with their costumes on

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:06.040
to check everything over.

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:09.970
So it can't really be done 
until right before the show.

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:10.680
Huh?

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:14.100
There are some things you can't check on 
until you've basically finished all rehearsing.

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:15.040
Huh?!

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:16.670
No way! No way!

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:19.840
I want to play with all of you 
in cute costumes!

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:21.050
Right now!

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:23.620
She's reverted to a child...

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:26.180
I want to! I want to!

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:26.810
If you want to do it that badly, 
I guess we'll have to.

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:30.310
Peek.

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:34.940
Cute!

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:34.940
It suits you.

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:39.690
I don't usually wear stuff 
like this, so it's new to me.

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:43.700
You don't work in the coffee shop at all?

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:46.080
I helped out once,

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:49.630
but it was too hard to resist 
the urge to sneak bites.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:52.460
<b>Staaaaare</b>

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:52.460
Makes sense.

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:56.840
Plus, skirts just feel too weird on me.

00:03:57.060 --> 00:03:59.650
Really? But it looks so nice.

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:03.090
But it's so loose and billowy, 
it's hard to move around in.

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:06.130
I can't run off at full speed.

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:10.980
I don't think you'll have many opportunities 
to run at full speed in the shop...

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:14.820
Hina-chan, you've been helping out 
in the coffee shop a lot, huh?

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:16.750
Are you used to wearing maid uniforms?

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:20.610
Yeah. It doesn't embarrass me 
as much as it used to.

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:23.570
That's why I got this one 
for you, Hina-chan!

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:28.480
Ta-da!

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:30.620
She's a bunny girl!

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:36.130
Wow... That's really cute.

00:04:36.470 --> 00:04:38.710
Hina-chan, you look sexy!

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:41.630
Isn't it a little too revealing, though?

00:04:44.870 --> 00:04:46.640
I-It's okay!

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:49.350
I just need to think of it 
as the coffee shop's uniform!

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:51.520
Why are you forcing this?

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:56.020
So cute!

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:59.250
I thought Yua-chan would
 look cute in an apron dress.

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:02.530
Yeah, well, I look cute in anything.

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:06.180
When we stand together like this,

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:08.090
you really stand out, Hina-chan.

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:08.970
Huh?

00:05:08.970 --> 00:05:09.970
You're right...

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:11.760
That's not true at all!

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:15.040
When we put Hina-chan and 
Yua-chan together...

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:16.400
See?

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:18.980
They look like they're from 
<i>Alice in Wonderland,</i> don't they?

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:21.210
R-Really?

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:24.170
This doesn't seem much like 
a fairy tale to me...

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:28.650
Alice and the rabbit, huh? I get it.

00:05:28.650 --> 00:05:31.720
That just leaves...

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:36.500
Wow!

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:39.190
Aki-chan has such a nice figure, 
it was hard to decide.

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:37.570
That looks great!

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:39.190
Beautiful!

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:43.380
Something like this could work, too.

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:45.300
Rawr.

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:48.010
Or even this, actually...

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:51.700
They're all so cute, I can't choose!

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:55.330
None of those are even 
in the script, though.

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:57.210
Yeah, I know!

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:58.880
Also, also...

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:02.710
I think something like this will look good 
on Hina-chan and Aki-chan, too!

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:09.250
Hey, those are basically just underwear!

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:12.970
I think they're really 
frilly and cute, though.

00:06:13.690 --> 00:06:16.000
Mayu-chan's out of control.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.980
She's taking this way too far.

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:22.500
But if these costumes 
will make our show better...

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:24.190
Why would you go that far?!

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:27.240
Do you actually <i>want</i> to wear that?!

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:29.490
Well...

00:06:29.770 --> 00:06:32.370
The truth is, um...

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:36.850
My mom is coming to visit 
Hitotose Manor soon.

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:38.000
What?!

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:41.390
I wanted her to see our first performance...

00:06:41.390 --> 00:06:46.700
So I want to put on a good show 
and put her mind at ease.

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:50.130
I'm sorry it's such a selfish reason, but...

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:54.780
We can't show Hina-chan's mom a messy shop!

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:58.520
I have to clean up, fast!

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:01.440
Is there a certain way 
your mom likes her meals flavored?

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.560
I'll start practicing it now!

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:07.330
Do you think we should wax the floors?

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:08.280
Good idea!

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:10.150
I want to get brand new bookshelves, too!

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:13.410
While we're at it, should we 
remodel the kitchen, too?

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.780
Then we should change the wallpaper.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:19.540
You guys need to put all that effort
 toward rehearsing!

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:21.790
Sheesh.

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:24.170
You should've told us that earlier.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:25.790
Don't be a stranger.

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:30.890
We're all partners in the Hitotose Troupe.

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:32.620
Of course we'll help you.

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:34.070
That's right, Hina-chan.

00:07:34.070 --> 00:07:35.920
Just leave it all to us.

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:39.870
Let's put on a great performance, 
for Hina-chan's mom!

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:40.640
Yeah!

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:45.790
Thank you, everyone!

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:52.290
Now that that's all worked out,

00:07:52.290 --> 00:07:54.820
why don't we have a toast?

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:57.430
And we can have a snack while we're at it...

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:02.700
It's a little early, but 
why don't we have dinner?

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:04.330
Yay!

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:08.130
Here you go.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:09.340
Thank you.

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:13.340
U-Um, who's going to do the toast?

00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:17.500
Oh...

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:22.400
I think the Hitotose Troupe's principal,
 Hina-chan, should do it.

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:24.230
Huh? Ah...

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:26.160
Go on, don't be shy.

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:27.730
We've all got our drinks.

00:08:28.720 --> 00:08:30.860
I can't wait any longer.

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:32.890
O-Okay!

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:34.900
Th-Then...

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:41.500
To the success of the 
Hitotose Troupe's first performance!

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:43.430
Cheers!

00:08:43.510 --> 00:08:45.620
Cheers!

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:47.630
<b>I don't need to study Japanese!
Or so I thought when I did my test
and got an awful score! (I really did it now)

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:50.130
<b>Coffee Shop</b>

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:54.010
That looks good!

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:54.910
Would you like some?

00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:56.560
Yeah! Thanks!

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:57.890
Greetings.

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:01.890
Are you having a costume party
 today or something?

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:03.830
No, um...

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:07.360
I came because I heard you 
had finished the script.

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:11.400
Yes, so we were having a bit 
of an early dress parade...

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:14.630
Sensei, would you like to wear one, too?

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:17.410
Mayu-chan's switch 
just got flipped on again!

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:20.930
So this is the route you're taking.

00:09:20.930 --> 00:09:26.190
I've been hoping to ask for your
advice since I started writing it.

00:09:26.190 --> 00:09:29.650
Yes, we do have limited stage space.

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:32.670
This has been such a fulfilling day!

00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:37.040
There's still one costume left.

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:38.920
That's a lovely dress.

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:41.310
Yeah, like one a princess would wear.

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.220
Mayu-chan!

00:09:45.220 --> 00:09:46.180
Yes?

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:49.070
Since we have this, why don't you try it on?

00:09:49.070 --> 00:09:49.850
Huh?

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:53.440
You did say you wanted to be a princess.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:54.420
Huh?!

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:56.320
And it looks like it's just your size.

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:57.350
Huh?!

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:00.070
Huh? Huh?

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:10.250
You're so cute, Mayu-chan!

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:12.020
It looks great on you.

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:13.700
It's like it was made-to-order!

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:16.110
You really do look like a princess!

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:22.220
Argh! I feel so embarrassed!

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:25.800
What's the problem?

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:27.380
It suits you!

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:29.190
Well...

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:33.400
Shall we do a reading right now?

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:35.800
Huh? Now?

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:39.250
We only have a few weeks 
until the performance.

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:42.570
We can't afford to waste a single second.

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:43.780
But if we start now,

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:47.160
it might get too late 
for you to get back home.

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:50.070
No need to worry.

00:10:50.070 --> 00:10:51.920
I came prepared.

00:10:57.630 --> 00:11:01.160
Y-You had every intention of 
spending the night here...

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:04.050
Tomorrow is Sunday, which means...

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:06.560
An impromptu training camp!

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:09.910
That's very sudden...

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:12.880
Go on, all you change into your pajamas.

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:14.190
Huh? Why?

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:17.120
This play takes place in a dream land,

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:18.770
a wonderland.

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:22.570
Don't you think pajamas would be 
the best costume to set the mood?

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:26.570
Um, that's not a "dream land."

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:28.200
It's a "wonderland."

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:32.340
That sounds kind of interesting!

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:34.360
I'll go change right away!

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:39.330
A pajama party...

00:11:41.890 --> 00:11:45.120
<i>I guess Ruri-chan really 
does like this sort of thing.</i>

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:45.920
Uh...

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:50.560
But I didn't bring pajamas or anything...

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:53.980
Don't worry. Leave it to me.

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:56.400
You can borrow my pajamas.

00:11:56.400 --> 00:12:00.860
I have some very nice, grown-up ones 
that would be perfect for you.

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:10.250
Who in the world are you?

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:13.250
You look just like a child.

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:14.500
You're not kidding.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:15.040
Huh?

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:16.000
Oh, sorry...

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:19.360
Despite how I look, I'm an adult!

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:23.990
Oh! You look so young, 
I thought you were a child.

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:27.010
Maybe that's a little too grown-up...

00:12:24.980 --> 00:12:26.510
Yua-chan?

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:42.440
<b>The Hitotose Troupe's First Performance 
A Strange Tale in a Strange Land 
Starting today at 5:00 PM</b>

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:42.440
Please come watch!

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:45.820
Please come watch!

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:48.830
Please come watch!

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:51.330
Please come watch!

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:54.620
<i>It's finally show time...</i>

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:56.410
<i>I'm worried.</i>

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:59.590
<i>Everything went perfectly 
in rehearsal, but...</i>

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:01.210
Hinako!

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:06.090
Long time no see!

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:07.590
Mom!

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:11.850
How've you been? I missed you!

00:13:13.300 --> 00:13:14.420
How's school?

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:16.420
You've grown a bit taller, haven't you?

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:16.420
U-Um...

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:17.730
Are you eating properly?

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:18.700
Um...

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:20.610
That's a cute costume!

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:22.280
<b>Hinako 
Wink at me!</b>

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:22.280
<b>Hinako 
I love you!</b>

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:22.280
<b>Hinako 
Please look 
at me!</b>

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:22.280
I brought some things to cheer you on.

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:23.610
Do you think it's enough?

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:25.570
To cheer me on?

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:28.210
Oh, it looks like there's some time 
before the performance.

00:13:28.210 --> 00:13:28.620
Huh?

00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:33.410
I'm going to check out Tokyo.

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:34.710
Take care of my things, okay?

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:36.000
O-Okay...

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.770
Well, Hinako...

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:41.750
Break a leg!

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:47.760
Your mom's so outgoing, unlike you.

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:54.520
Huh? Your mom went sightseeing?

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.390
<b>Hinako 
Wave at me!</b>

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.390
<b>Hinako 
Wink at me!</b>

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.390
I wanted to meet her.

00:13:56.680 --> 00:14:00.000
As your landlady, 
I was hoping to talk to her.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.400
Sorry...

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:07.530
My mom has always been very active, 
outgoing, and dynamic...

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:10.530
She's the exact opposite of me.

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:14.290
W-Well, lots of kids are 
nothing like their parents!

00:14:14.560 --> 00:14:17.790
My mom was a tea ceremony instructor,

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.420
so she was strict about manners.

00:14:20.310 --> 00:14:22.680
We don't have the same taste 
in clothes, either.

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:24.180
It's no fun.

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:28.430
My dad is a free spirit,

00:14:28.690 --> 00:14:32.190
so I need to do a good job 
running the shops.

00:14:32.190 --> 00:14:35.810
For you, that's a pretty 
serious problem, huh?

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:39.270
Yay! Amigo!

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:42.270
<b>The Hitotose Troupe's First Performance 
A Strange Tale in a Strange Land 
Starting today at 5:00 PM 
Location: Coffee Shop Hitotose</b>

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:48.280
<b>The Hitotose Troupe's First Performance 
A Strange Tale in a Strange Land 
Today at 5:00 PM</b>

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:50.910
Do come in!

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:53.030
<b>Reserved 
Seat</b>

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:53.030
Welcome to Hitotose!

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:55.440
Have you decided what you'd like to order?

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:57.790
This is what we're recommending today.

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:00.790
<b>I ran after the white rabbit.
I was so busy running after it, 
I somehow ended up upside down mid-air!
I'm going to hit the ground!
I closed my eyes tight and braced for impact.
Poof

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:00.790
<b>Startled by that voice, I looked up.
I gently pet the warm, white object...
This fur is...
"Rabbit fur...?"
I heard the voice again.
"Come on! I have to hurry 
to the Queen's palace!"

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:12.050
<b>Hitotose Troupe 
Full House! 
We're sorry. 
All seats are filled.</b>

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:10.210
The audience seats have really filled up.

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:12.050
Are you all right?

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:15.870
I-I'm still okay right now,

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:19.020
but I feel like I'll get nervous 
when I see my mom...

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:21.100
Greetings, everyone.

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:27.100
I'll be watching your performance 
with my mother today.

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:28.190
Hello.

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:30.770
Oh! I've seen her on TV!

00:15:30.770 --> 00:15:32.420
I think she's a model...

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:35.310
Everyone in Sensei's family is famous.

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:40.080
Hina-chan is already a scarecrow 
after seeing Sensei's mom!

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:48.650
Why would you get nervous from 
seeing someone else's mom?!

00:15:50.230 --> 00:15:53.590
Well, I would recommend this.

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:57.600
Will you flambé that with brandy, then?

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:02.980
Oh, I'm sorry, but we don't serve 
alcoholic beverages here...

00:16:03.410 --> 00:16:05.470
Okay, breathe in...

00:16:06.630 --> 00:16:08.150
And out.

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:14.880
It is kind of nerve-wracking to have 
our families watching, isn't it?

00:16:14.880 --> 00:16:18.990
I didn't really like Parents' Day 
at school when I was little, either.

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:21.380
When I had to read out loud,

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:21.380
...held his umbrella over the fox.

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:24.000
I'd accidentally hold 
my textbook upside-down.

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:25.760
The fox looked at the old man in surprise,

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:28.750
Oh, but I had the whole book 
memorized, so it was fine.

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:28.750
then it barked happily.

00:16:29.020 --> 00:16:34.010
I once forgot my lines 
when I was on the stage.

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:38.140
I got through the rest 
by ad-libbing, but still...

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:41.690
Th-That's right! If you keep 
wishing and never give up,

00:16:41.690 --> 00:16:43.520
your dream will come true!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:46.650
Yeah, because you're both geniuses...

00:16:47.170 --> 00:16:50.210
Actually, if you tell yourself 
it's okay to mess up,

00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:52.220
you won't get as nervous.

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:54.150
R-Really?

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:59.340
I once messed up during a dance recital 
and fell into the audience,

00:16:59.340 --> 00:17:03.040
but I got right back on the stage 
and kept dancing until the end.

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:06.320
Even I, the great Yua-sama, 
messes up sometimes!

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:08.120
So don't feel bad!

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:12.550
Yua-chan, you're amazing!

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:16.100
I never would have recovered 
from something like that!

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:19.240
Just imagining it makes me start shaking...

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:22.930
<i>Crap! It had the opposite effect!</i>

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:28.560
No, listen! What I'm saying is that 
you don't have to be afraid of messing up!

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:29.630
Hina-chan.

00:17:30.350 --> 00:17:33.190
Just remember our play 
at the culture festival.

00:17:33.640 --> 00:17:35.310
The culture festival?

00:17:35.310 --> 00:17:37.950
Yeah. Remember the handkerchief?

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:46.400
Actually, you're right. That 
somehow worked out okay, didn't it?

00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:47.840
That's right.

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:50.710
So you shouldn't be afraid 
of making mistakes.

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:56.140
You succeeded in making 
Hina-chan feel better!

00:17:56.140 --> 00:17:58.520
I know I mess up all the time, okay?!

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:04.720
We'll be there to help you, so don't worry.

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:08.490
Let's show your mom how cool you can be!

00:18:08.490 --> 00:18:10.610
Y-Yeah!

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:16.990
L-Let's do it!

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:19.240
Yeah!

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:21.120
<i>That's right.</i>

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:24.130
<i>For the sake of all these girls 
who are supporting me,</i>

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:26.870
<i>I have to make our 
first performance a success!</i>

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:40.390
<i>I psyched myself up 
before coming out here, but...</i>

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:43.510
Hinako! Knock 'em dead!

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:42.390
<b>Hinako</b>

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:43.510
<b>Hinapon 
LOVE</b>

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:45.760
I'm right here watching!

00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:47.890
Your mom's on your side!

00:18:48.180 --> 00:18:51.600
<i>She really is making me nervous!</i>

00:18:48.180 --> 00:18:52.660
Yay! Yay! Hinako! Go! Go! Hinako!

00:18:53.920 --> 00:18:56.760
<i>Hina-chan's turning into a scarecrow...</i>

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:00.660
Uh...

00:19:01.010 --> 00:19:05.180
Before we start, I'd like to say 
a few words as the shop owner.

00:19:09.150 --> 00:19:13.520
Our shops, Used Bookstore Hitotose 
and Coffee Shop Hitotose,

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:15.200
Hina-chan, look at that.

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:16.920
produced this play for the 
entertainment of customers

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:15.920
Huh?

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:17.920
<b>1) Where am I? 
What is this place I've come to? 
2)Why, hello.</b>

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:21.930
visiting during the shopping 
district's stamp rally.

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:21.930
Cue cards made with the shop's menu rolls...

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:24.930
This is our theater troupe's 
very first performance,

00:19:22.190 --> 00:19:24.930
Mayu-chan was up all night making them.

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:30.190
but we hope to earn your future support 
as we move forward from here.

00:19:26.350 --> 00:19:30.190
Just look at Mayu-chan standing up as 
tall as she can to show us our lines,

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:31.980
Also, our stamps for the stamp rally

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:31.980
and it'll soothe your soul.

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:38.370
can be collected at the table 
outside the shop,

00:19:32.240 --> 00:19:33.790
That's what you meant?!

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:36.070
Don't just stand still all day!

00:19:36.930 --> 00:19:40.450
I'll move first, so you just follow me.

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:40.450
so please visit it later.

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:44.870
<i>They're doing all this just for me...</i>

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:53.150
<i>That's right.</i>

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:56.460
<i>I'm not standing on this stage alone.</i>

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:02.470
Where am I?

00:20:02.730 --> 00:20:05.470
What is this place I've come to?

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:08.350
Oh? And who are you?

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:12.100
Allow me to welcome you, miss.

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:16.360
Welcome to a land so exciting, 
you'll be unable to sleep.

00:20:16.700 --> 00:20:20.110
Welcome to a land so fun, 
you'll be unable to leave.

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:23.490
Welcome to Wonderland.

00:20:23.840 --> 00:20:26.440
<i>I'm going to show my mom</i>

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:30.570
<i>the best play I can put on, 
with my wonderful friends!</i>

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:35.120
<b>When you can't do it right, lie down on your back and breathe.
You can tell that your stomach moves up and down,
rather than your lungs.

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:41.130
I'm sorry, everyone!

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:43.730
I'm the principal,

00:20:43.730 --> 00:20:47.510
but I put you all through so much trouble...

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:51.650
We got everything 
back on track, so it's fine.

00:20:51.650 --> 00:20:54.520
The audience didn't seem to mind, either.

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:56.200
But...

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:59.020
You weren't moving at all in the beginning,

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:01.780
so I thought you were playing 
a scarecrow or something.

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:11.250
But then you acted out your part
 until the very end.

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:12.790
You did so well.

00:21:13.030 --> 00:21:15.420
You're grown up, Hinako.

00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:17.670
Mom...

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:19.520
Isn't that great, Hina-chan?

00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:21.710
You've put your mom's mind at ease.

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:24.860
Yeah! Thanks!

00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:26.590
It's because of all of you!

00:21:27.460 --> 00:21:32.350
<i>I'm so glad I came to Hitotose Manor!</i>

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:36.350
Well, it's time to catch 
my bullet train, so I'll be going.

00:21:36.610 --> 00:21:37.300
Huh?!

00:21:37.300 --> 00:21:40.300
Girls, take care of Hinako for me!

00:21:52.490 --> 00:21:54.540
She's like a storm.

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:34.760
<b>From One Year to the Next</b>

00:23:26.330 --> 00:23:29.300
Lots of things have happened

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:31.530
since Hina-chan came to Hitotose Manor.

00:23:32.050 --> 00:23:36.040
I hope next year will be a good year, too.

00:23:36.610 --> 00:23:39.440
Next time, "From One Year to the Next."
